{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disruptive Role Reversal:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, you\u2019re not a savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide which version of humanity is allowed to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual Identities, Two Faces</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 A restrained and compassionate physician, operating within the boundaries of law and order.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 The mask comes off. Unconventional methods are employed to remove variables that cannot be controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Timelines. Seamless Travel</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old World (21st century)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Free cities rise. The future looks bright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 Only you know that a global catastrophe is already in motion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The New World (22nd century)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 War has ended. Welfare is universal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 Gifted individuals accelerate technological progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 And yet you see the truth: this seemingly perfect world is slowly collapsing under the weight of genetic inequality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757460/extras/bda01cd49dac235ea461149a5f51c94f.avif?t=1771864541\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Your choices may redeem both timelines, sacrifice one for the other, or plunge all into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power from the shadows:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Act as the hidden hand, navigating factions and shaping the course of history.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions without full truth:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Gather fragmented information through story events, archives, and exploration\u2014and decide anyway.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based branching narrative:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Choices ripple forward, altering relationships and the balance of power over time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable protagonist:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Choose your character\u2019s gender and name.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ illustrated characters, 4 major narrative branches, 10+ distinct endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757460/extras/495ef341305ccb100ddb152777a3323e.avif?t=1771864541\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Before You Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game centers on morally gray decisions and offers no clear-cut good or evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large-scale world with dense characters and complex branching\u2014expect a high cognitive load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a power fantasy. Not a feel-good story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to budget limitations, some background assets are AI-assisted.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757460?t=1771864541","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37574